OL,3,GNEWSACarragher settles tax debt to
OL,4,Aavoid bankruptcy
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Premier League footballer Jamie
OL,7,FCarragher, 48, will not be made
OL,8,Fbankrupt after he settled an unpaid tax
OL,9,Fbill with HM Revenue and Customs
OL,10,F(HMRC).
OL,12,FJudge Nicholas Briggs dismissed a
OL,13,Fbankruptcy petition issued in August
OL,14,Fagainst the ex-Liverpool defender at
OL,15,Fthe Insolvency and Companies Court
OL,16,Fearlier.
OL,18,FKevin Hassan, for HMRC, told the
OL,19,Fhearing in London that the debt has
OL,20,Fbeen paid, with no figure given in
OL,21,Fcourt. It was previously said to be in
OL,22,Fthe region of #700,000 to #800,000.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
