OL,3,GNEWSACarragher settles tax debt to
OL,4,Aavoid bankruptcy
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarragher, from Merseyside, spent his
OL,7,Fentire professional career with
OL,8,FLiverpool and was part of the squad
OL,9,Fwhich won the Champions League in 2005.
